{"headword":"שָׁבָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. take captive (</strong>NH, Old Aramaic id.; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">سَبَا (سبى)</span>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבָא ܫܒܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.14\">Je 41:14</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשָׁבָם</span> (consec.) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.12\">43:12</a> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשָׁבָה</span> Gie; Du conj. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשָֽׁמְמוּ</span>); 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁבִיתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.22\">2 K 6:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:19\" href=\"/Psalms.68.19\">ψ 68:19</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּשְׁבְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:1\" href=\"/Numbers.21.1\">Nu 21:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.10\">Je 41:10</a>, etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּשְׁבֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:12\" href=\"/Judges.5.12\">Ju 5:12</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:11\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.11\">Ob 11</a>; Pt. act. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.2\">Is 14:2</a>, etc.; pass. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבוּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.1\">Is 61:1</a>, fpl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבֻיוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:26\" href=\"/Genesis.31.26\">Gn 31:26</a>;—<em>take captive:</em>"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"c. acc. pers., <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:22\" href=\"/Numbers.24.22\">Nu 24:22</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.2\">1 S 30:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.2\">2 K 5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.22\">6:22</a> (+ ב instr.) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.10\">Je 41:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (but v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.10\">10b</a> Gie reads <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּשְׁכֵּם</span>, cf. 𝔊 Luc), v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:29\" href=\"/Genesis.34.29\">Gn 34:29</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.8\">2 Ch 28:8</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> part.), + 6 times; + <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.12\">Je 43:12</a> appar. c. acc. idols (but v. supra; acc. of land Gie)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵילוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:11\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.11\">Ob 11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽרְכוּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 21:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.21.17\">2 Ch 21:17</a>, cattle, etc., <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.21\">1 Ch 5:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.14\">2 Ch 14:14</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"pt. in periphrast. conjug. <span dir=\"rtl\">(לְשֹׁבֵיהֶם) וְהָיוּ שֹׁבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.2\">Is 14:2</a>; pt. c. sf. = <em>their captives</em>, etc., <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:46\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.46\">1 K 8:46</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:36\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.36\">2 Ch 6:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.2\">Is 14:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:33\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.33\">Je 50:33</a>, + 5 times; pt. pass. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.1\">Is 61:1</a> = <em>captives;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּשְׁבֻיוֹת חָ֑רֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:26\" href=\"/Genesis.31.26\">Gn 31:26</a> my daughters <em>as captives of the sword</em>."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"c. acc. cogn. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:12\" href=\"/Judges.5.12\">Ju 5:12</a> <em>lead captive thy captives</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:19\" href=\"/Psalms.68.19\">ψ 68:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.17\">2 Ch 28:17</a>, so (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> pers.) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:1\" href=\"/Numbers.21.1\">Nu 21:1</a> (JE), and (acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁבְיָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.5\">2 Ch 28:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.11\">11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ שִׁבְיוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.10\">Dt 21:10</a> = <em>take him captive</em>."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be taken captive:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁבָּה</span>, of man <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:14\" href=\"/Genesis.14.14\">Gn 14:14</a>, of beast <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:9\" href=\"/Exodus.22.9\">Ex 22:9</a> (E), of <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדֶר י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.17\">Je 13:17</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁבּוּ</span>, human subj. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.3\">1 S 30:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:47\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.47\">1 K 8:47</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:37\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.37\">2 Ch 6:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.9\">Ez 6:9</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"form":"Niph."}]},"rid":"BDB09881","strong_numbers":["7617"],"next_hw":"שְׁבִי","prev_hw":"שָׁבִיב","root":true,"occurrences":"47","quotes":[],"GK":["8647"],"TWOT":["2311"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}